WEBVTT

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.720
Det er bare en kort video

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.060
Huh. Vent et øyeblikk.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.270
Det kan ta et øyeblikk å laste ned.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:42.530
(Latter)

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.770
Vi vil bare -- vi kan bare hoppe over --

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.120
Jeg kan bare hoppe over videoen.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.640
(Latter)

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.000
Nei.